      "display_name": "OpenMC pin-cell — ScaleNuSigmaF (k_eff increases)",
      "description": "Monte Carlo counterpart of the OpenMOC ScaleNuSigmaF MR. Scaling the fuel material's nu-sigma-f cross section by factor > 1 must monotonically increase k_eff in OpenMC's multi-group eigenvalue solve, just as it does in OpenMOC's deterministic transport solve. Same MR, different solver.",
